    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Fundamental Duties apply strictly to Indian citizens and do not extend to foreigners.",
        "The Swaran Singh Committee recommended 8 duties, but 10 duties were included via the 42nd Amendment Act, 1976.",
        "Fundamental Duties are non-justiciable, but Parliament can enact legislation to enforce specific duties."
      ],
